         <dc:title>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Validez de la definiciÃ³n de caso de InfecciÃ³n Respiratoria Aguda Grave basada en cÃ³digos CIE-10 en cuatro comunidades autÃ³nomas (EspaÃ±a, 2021-2023). [Validity of case definitions for Severe Acute Respiratory Infection based on ICD-10 codes in four autonomous communities (Spain, 2021-2023).]</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:title>
         <dc:creator>
            <rdf:Bag>
               <rdf:li>Marcos Lozano Ãlvarez</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Alba Moya GarcÃ©s</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Liher Imaz Goienetxea</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>Ana SofÃ­a Lameiras Azevedo</rdf:li>
               <rdf:li>MarÃ­a Teresa Otero Barros</rdf:li>
